SDOA Architecture Evolution Specification: v4.5 to v5.0
Status: CANONICAL INTELLECTUAL ARTIFACTDomain: Dynamic Polyglot Orchestration, Evolutionary Software SystemsCore Standard: The Manifesto is the Contract. The Registrar is the Roster. The Registry is the Spine.  1. Executive Context & Architectural Paradigm ShiftTraditional system integration patterns view technical debt as an inevitability—a consequence of codebases becoming coupled to the operational compromises of the era in which they were written.SDOA v5.0 permanently breaks this cycle by transforming the architecture from a static, single-language compilation target into a Dynamic Evolutionary Ecosystem.Plaintext                                  ┌───────────────────────────┐
